      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think i have a uti or something. it burns so bad when i pee and i feel this heavy pressure in my lower pelvis. i really rly want to avoid antibiotics if i can because they always wreck my gut health and i'm trying to stay natural. do u think like super high doses of oregano oil or concentrated cranberry could actually kill the bacteria and fix it at home? i'm looking for a specific protocol or dosage i can follow.",
